msgstr "Telusuri..."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Config directory"
msgstr "Direktori konfigurasi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where sm2-emu.ini is read from and saved to.\n"
"Set with --config <dir>; cannot be changed here."
msgstr ""
"Tempat sm2-emu.ini dibaca dan disimpan.\n"
"Diatur dengan --config <dir>; tidak dapat diubah di sini."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROM directory"
msgstr "Direktori ROM"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where the ROM archives live. A game launched by name is\n"
"loaded from here as <name>.zip or <name>.7z."
msgstr ""
"Tempat arsip ROM berada. Game yang diluncurkan dengan nama\n"
"dimuat dari sini sebagai <name>.zip atau <name>.7z."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves directory"
msgstr "Direktori simpanan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Battery-backed saves: per-game NVRAM (.nv) and EEPROM\n"
"(.eeprom) images -- high scores and operator settings."
msgstr ""
"Simpanan berbaterai: image NVRAM (.nv) dan EEPROM (.eeprom)\n"
"per game -- skor tertinggi dan pengaturan operator."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshots directory"
msgstr "Direktori tangkapan layar"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where F12 screenshots are written."
msgstr "Tempat tangkapan layar F12 ditulis."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scrape artwork online"
msgstr "Ambil artwork secara online"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let the game picker fetch box art and descriptions from\n"
"ArcadeDB over the network. Off keeps sm2-emu offline: the\n"
"picker still lists and launches every game, with placeholder\n"
"tiles and no descriptions."
msgstr ""
"Biarkan pemilih game mengambil sampul dan deskripsi dari\n"
"ArcadeDB melalui jaringan. Mati membuat sm2-emu tetap offline:\n"
"pemilih tetap menampilkan dan meluncurkan semua game, dengan\n"
"gambar pengganti dan tanpa deskripsi."

