#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wheel connected."
msgstr "Setir terhubung."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "No wheel connected. Settings still apply once one is."
msgstr "Tidak ada setir terhubung. Pengaturan tetap berlaku saat ada."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Force feedback"
msgstr "Force feedback"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wheel force on driving games: centring and cornering\n"
"forces decoded from the game's own drive-board commands,\n"
"plus an impact jolt when you hit something."
msgstr ""
"Gaya setir pada game balap: gaya pemusatan dan menikung\n"
"yang didekode dari perintah drive board milik game,\n"
"ditambah hentakan saat Anda menabrak sesuatu."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resistance"
msgstr "Resistansi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Invert force feedback"
msgstr "Balik force feedback"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a wheel whose driver pushes the wrong way: it pulls\n"
"away from the centre instead of bringing it back, and\n"
"the game's forces go the opposite way."
msgstr ""
"Untuk setir yang drivernya mendorong ke arah salah: setir\n"
"menjauh dari tengah alih-alih kembali, dan gaya\n"
"dari game berlawanan arah."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble"
msgstr "Getaran"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Vibrates on the game's impacts, for wheels without force\n"
"feedback. It never runs alongside force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Bergetar saat benturan dalam game, untuk setir tanpa force\n"
"feedback. Tidak pernah berjalan bersamaan dengan force feedback."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble strength"
msgstr "Kekuatan getaran"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Engine vibration"
msgstr "Getaran mesin"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An added vibration that grows with the throttle. It is not\n"
"from the game. Turn it off to feel only the game's force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Getaran tambahan yang meningkat seiring gas. Ini bukan\n"
"dari game. Matikan untuk merasakan hanya force feedback game."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%u deg"
msgstr "%u derajat"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering range"
msgstr "Rentang kemudi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set this to your wheel's own rotation range. The lock\n"
"angle below is mapped onto it, so matching your wheel\n"
"gives arcade-like response."
msgstr ""
"Atur ke rentang putar setir Anda sendiri. Sudut kunci\n"
"di bawah dipetakan ke sana, jadi menyamakannya dengan\n"
"setir memberi respons seperti arcade."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lock angle"
msgstr "Sudut kunci"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%d deg"
msgstr "%d derajat"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How far to physically turn for full game lock (total,\n"
"so half each side of centre). Lower is more sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Seberapa jauh memutar secara fisik untuk kunci penuh game\n"
"(total, jadi setengah tiap sisi). Lebih rendah = lebih sensitif."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Axes"
msgstr "Sumbu"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto-detected. Recalibrate if steering or a pedal is wrong."
msgstr "Terdeteksi otomatis. Kalibrasi ulang jika kemudi atau pedal salah."

