msgid ""
"Click, then push a stick.\n"
"Right-click to go back to the default."
msgstr ""
"Klik, lalu dorong sebuah stik.\n"
"Klik kanan untuk kembali ke bawaan."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click, then pull the trigger, push a stick\n"
"or press a button. Right-click for the default."
msgstr ""
"Klik, lalu tarik pelatuk, dorong stik\n"
"atau tekan tombol. Klik kanan untuk bawaan."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click, then press a button or pull a trigger.\n"
"Right-click to unbind."
msgstr ""
"Klik, lalu tekan tombol atau tarik pelatuk.\n"
"Klik kanan untuk melepas."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The left stick also moves; the shoulders also act as Button 3/4. Right Lever "
"is Virtual On's. Test and Service are Guide+Start and Guide+Back."
msgstr "Stik kiri juga menggerakkan; tombol bahu juga berfungsi sebagai Tombol 3/4. Tuas Kanan adalah milik Virtual On. Tes dan Servis adalah Guide+Start dan Guide+Back."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stick sensitivity"
msgstr "Sensitivitas stik"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Response of a stick's travel past its deadzone. Full deflection\n"
"is always full lock; under 100% the middle of the travel does\n"
"less, over 100% it does more."
msgstr ""
"Respons gerakan stik melewati deadzone. Defleksi penuh\n"
"selalu kunci penuh; di bawah 100% bagian tengah gerakan\n"
"berefek lebih kecil, di atas 100% lebih besar."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Vibrates on the game's impacts in driving games.\n"
"Other games stay quiet."
msgstr ""
"Bergetar saat benturan dalam game balap.\n"
"Game lain tetap diam."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering vibration"
msgstr "Getaran kemudi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An added vibration that grows as you steer. It is not\n"
"from the game. Turn it off to feel only the game's force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Getaran tambahan yang meningkat saat Anda berbelok. Ini bukan\n"
"dari game. Matikan untuk merasakan hanya force feedback game."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Atur ulang"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Per-game volume"
msgstr "Volume per game"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Raise or lower a game's volume from its default level.\n"
"One slider covers every revision of a game. Off plays\n"
"every game at its default, whatever the sliders say.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: above 100% loud effects can clip (audible\n"
"distortion)."
msgstr ""
"Naikkan atau turunkan volume game dari level bawaannya.\n"
"Satu slider mencakup semua revisi sebuah game. Mati\n"
"memainkan semua game pada level bawaan, apa pun slidernya.\n"
"\n"
"Peringatan: di atas 100% efek keras bisa clipping (distorsi\n"
"yang terdengar)."

