#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No dedicated light guns detected. Player 1 aims with the mouse; the left "
"button fires and the right button reloads (shoot off screen). Plug in guns "
"tagged ID_INPUT_GUN for independent per-player aiming."
msgstr "Tidak ada light gun khusus terdeteksi. Pemain 1 membidik dengan mouse; tombol kiri menembak dan tombol kanan mengisi ulang (tembak ke luar layar). Colokkan senjata bertanda ID_INPUT_GUN untuk bidikan terpisah per pemain."

